# Runtime data (interviews, resumes, caches, the database) stays out of git - it is personal
# data. The reference tables the facts layer corrects against are part of the program and
# ship with it; without them a fresh clone silently stopped correcting institution names.
data/*
!data/reference/
data/reference/*.sqlite3
__pycache__/
.env
make_sample_docs.py
